<span class="cs-line cmt"># Scaling law for CC pool optimality</span>
<span class="cs-line"></span>
<span class="cs-line cmt"># N*(M, m): training steps for CC to beat</span>
<span class="cs-line cmt"># RefinedWeb, given model size M, pool size m</span>
<span class="cs-line"></span>
<span class="cs-line hl-p"><span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">N_star</span>(M, m):</span>
<span class="cs-line hl-p">  <span class="str">"""Min N s.t. loss(CC, M, N) &lt; loss(RW, M, N')"""</span></span>
